# Commit Messages

Read and follow the [Commit messages section in AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md#commit-messages),
the shared source of project rules for Codex and Cursor.

The basis is [Conventional Commits 1.0.0](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/),
with a required scope: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`. Keep messages concise and
document detailed changes during development instead of listing them in commit bodies.

Example: `feat(settings): add light and dark theme toggle`
